SUMMARY:Megan O'Rourke Book Talk
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a conversation on public scholarship with Meghan 
 O’Rourke\, editor of The Yale Review and author of The Invisible Kingd
 om: Reimagining Chronic Illness\, a 2022 National Book Award Finalist fo
 r Nonfiction. O’Rourke will discuss the health humanities\, writing fo
 r audiences beyond the academy\, and the making of her latest project\, 
 an anthology of poetry about illness and recovery. She will take your qu
 estions about the behind-the-scenes of these innovative projects\, about
  publishing with trade presses and magazines\, and about editing The Yal
 e Review\, a flagship magazine of public schola\nhttps://www.princeton.e
 du/events/2026/megan-orourke-book-talk
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/megan-orourke-book-talk
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
