SUMMARY:CST Student Town Hall
DESCRIPTION:In the coming year\, the Center on Science and Technology (CS
 T) will undergo a reorganization. Because the CST engages students in mu
 ltiple ways\, including StudioLab\, we are hosting a town hall to hear f
 rom students directly and invite you to reflect on the meaningful experi
 ences our community members have working with us. This open forum is als
 o a way for you to help guide what may come next for CST. All comments a
 nd questions are welcome\, whether short\, long\, personal\, big-picture
 \, practical\, or conceptual. We look forward to hearing from you.\nhttp
 s://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/cst-student-town-hall
