SUMMARY:Friends of PUL Small Talk: Tsundoku: What isn't in "The Art of Ja
 panese Publishing" Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Thursday\, November 12 for a Friends Small Talk an
 d showcase featuring Nicole Fabricand-Person '76\, *01. You may have hea
 rd of the Japanese term\, “tsundoku” that has become fashionable in 
 English to describe the phenomenon of purchasing books and letting them 
 pile up without being read. Taking liberty with the term\, this Small Ta
 lk will introduce some of the wonderful books in the Marquand Library Co
 llection that either had to be cut from the exhibition or were purchased
  too late to be included—they were therefore purchased\, but “unread
 ” by our visitors. Program timeline: 5:00pm-5:30\nhttps://www.princeto
 n.edu/events/2026/friends-pul-small-talk-tsundoku-what-isnt-art-japanese
