SUMMARY:Anthony Roth Costanzo In Conversation With Wendy Heller: "Counter
 tenor"
DESCRIPTION:Anthony Roth Costanzo is joined in conversation with Wendy He
 ller\, Princeton University's Scheide Professor of Music History and for
 mer Chair of the Music Department. Anthony's new book "Countertenor" is 
 a lively and revelatory exploration of the history of the countertenor\,
  by the Grammy Award-winning star of Philip Glass’s Akhnaten and “on
 e of opera’s biggest stars” (The New York Times). The evening will i
 nclude a performance by Anthony. The sound of a countertenor—often des
 cribed as ethereal and otherworldly—is both familiar and foreign. It i
 s a high voice close to what we might expect from\nhttps://www.princeton
 .edu/events/2026/anthony-roth-costanzo-conversation-wendy-heller-counter
 tenor
