 jecture: Inside the Mind of a Mathematician Q&A moderated by Akshay Venk
 atesh School of Mathematics\, IAS. Chandrashekhar Khare is a professor o
 f mathematics at UCLA. Together with Jean-Pierre Wintenberger\, he prove
 d Serre’s conjecture\, which connects Galois representations and modul
 ar forms\, two central objects in number theory. His memoir\, Chasing (a
 ) Conjecture\, tells the personal story behind this work.\nhttps://www.p
