 lly hilarious exchanges with the many faces of the party. As she tries t
 o rock the boat\, will she be able to see beyond her heartache and recog
 nize the true character of the people around her? Or will she sink under
  the weight of old habits\, resolute in her bitter perceptions of love?F
 eaturing senior Pixley Marquardt and co-dir\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/e
