DESCRIPTION:Make sure your resume is ready for upcoming deadlines. During
  this program\, you'll have a quick meeting with an adviser who will pro
 vide you with actionable feedback on how to improve your resume. Only on
 e resume per student will be reviewed during this event. If you need mor
 e documents to be reviewed or have questions about internship or job sea
 rch\, please come for drop-in advising (https://careerdevelopment.prince
 ton.edu/advising-programs/advising/drop-in-hours) (no appointment needed
 ) at the Center for Career Development or schedule an appointment (https
 ://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/advising-programs/make-appointment). 
 This program is open to all Princeton University undergraduates regardle
 ss of identity. Email careerdevelopment@princeton.edu to request accommo
 dations at least two weeks prior to the program.\nRegister: https://prin
 ceton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1979422\nhttps://careerdevelopment.pr
 inceton.edu/events/resume-review-day
