SUMMARY:Ritty Lukose | Generation as Conjuncture: Youth and the Politics 
 of Aspiration in India Today
DESCRIPTION:In July of this year\, a so-called “Gen Z” protest moveme
 nt erupted in New Delhi\, with solidarity protests in key cities around 
 the country and globally. Relatively rare within the current BJP dominat
 ed political context\, the protests have highlighted the social category
  of youth and generation as key faultlines within contemporary India. Mo
 ving beyond the label “Gen Z”\, Ritty Lukose argues that understandi
 ng the concept of generation through a conjunctural frame draws out how 
 the shifting trajectories of more than three decades of liberalization h
 ave transformed structures of aspiration and th\nhttps://www.princeton.e
 du/events/2026/ritty-lukose-generation-conjuncture-youth-and-politics-as
 piration-india-today
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/ritty-lukose-generation-conjunc
 ture-youth-and-politics-aspiration-india-today
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
