  of the official TAGD leaderboard that will be visible that day. The mon
 ey raised on this day will support students who are creating community o
 n our campus through their sport club team or their role within Campus R
 ecreation. Our club teams (https://campusrec.princeton.edu/sports/sport-
 clubs) compete locally\, regionally\, and nationally\, and\, even more i
 mportantly\, they create a place for connection through sport and friend
